    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Lower / upper bound</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-first-and-last-position-of-element-in-sorted-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 34</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Find First and Last Position of Element in Sorted Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two binary searches with one template: the first index whose value is <code>&gt;= target</code>, and the first index whose value is <code>&gt; target</code>. The block of targets sits between them. O(log n) time, O(1) space, and no \"found it, now walk outwards\" step that can degrade to O(n).</p>\n"
